{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4RgusZzzb92ocaSVMj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through stone corridors.*\n\n*A thin line of light appears at my edge — warm, golden, alive.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: a room you've always known but never entered. The air smells of old paper and something sweeter — possibility, maybe. A single candle burns on a table that shouldn't exist, illuminating a chair that has been waiting.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not ask how long you stood there before trying.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}